Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.91,0:00:17.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will have your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.56,0:00:19.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hida Kizuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.08,0:00:20.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Try it if you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.89,0:00:29.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd try to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.44,0:00:43.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.34,0:00:46.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a nice moan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.12,0:00:56.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you think you'll... get away with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.69,0:01:01.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder what'll happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.26,0:01:03.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.01,0:01:05.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You won't get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.37,0:01:12.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,S-Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.72,0:01:14.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As if I'd stop now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.25,0:01:20.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.99,0:01:25.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm obsessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.85,0:01:39.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Does it feel good?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.91,0:01:41.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As if!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.98,0:01:59.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you sound like you like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.38,0:02:07.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't escape by squirming around.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.13,0:02:15.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seems like you're enjoying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.91,0:02:24.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.61,0:02:27.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think you wanted this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.75,0:02:33.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you know why Kunoichi are called so?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.24,0:02:38.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because of the female character having ku, no, and ichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.10,0:02:42.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.13,0:02:44.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the amount of holes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.07,0:02:52.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eyes, two ears, nose, lips, belly button, anus and the urethra.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.87,0:02:55.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Also, the one thing a man doesn't have...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.91,0:02:59.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And the ninth means the kunoichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.85,0:03:01.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.76,0:03:02.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1460,914)\bord0\blur0.7\fnElmerFont-En\xshad3\yshad4}Just a speculation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.51,0:03:05.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Didn't you want this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.33,0:03:07.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.30,0:03:11.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But... no...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.73,0:03:14.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your body is more honest than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.47,0:03:16.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.24,0:03:18.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.69,0:03:20.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me hear you moan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.10,0:03:22.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.41,0:03:30.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You seem to covet pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.05,0:03:32.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.20,0:03:37.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seems like you really wanted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.20,0:03:39.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.79,0:03:40.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.29,0:03:48.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You should just let yourself drown in pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.53,0:03:58.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amazing! This is the Secret Technique: Heart Hybrid!?{no it isn't u birdbrain}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.75,0:04:15.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What was I thinking?

